  "instructions": [
    "1. In a large bowl, combine danmuji, carrot, lettuce, and red onion.",
    "2. In a small bowl, whisk together apple cider vinegar, lemon juice, and olive oil.",
    "3. Pour the dressing over the danmuji mixture and toss to coat.",
    "4. Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "5. Sprinkle parsley over the top and serve.",
    "6. Refrigerate for at least 30 minutes to allow the flavors to meld.",
    "7. Serve chilled and enjoy!"
